  "html": "<div class=\"group col-span-full not-first:mt-6 py-8\"><section class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] multi-columns:flex multi-columns:px-0\"><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-1 @md:col-span-8 @md:col-start-3\"><div data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-carousel-view\"><div class=\"mb-3 flex justify-end\"><div data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-controls\" class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"text-meta text-primary-60\">1 条/ 共 4 条</span><div class=\"flex\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ease-curve-a disabled:text-gray-40 items-center justify-center outline-offset-2 duration-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-0 flex rounded-sm transition size-8 focus:outline-primary-44 text-btn-media-label\" disabled=\"\" aria-label=\"上一条客户评价\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><use href=\"/icons/cms/27bb77900ed6df73/arrow-left-lg.svg#size-16\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></use></svg></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ease-curve-a disabled:text-gray-40 items-center justify-center outline-offset-2 duration-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-0 flex rounded-sm transition size-8 text-primary-60 hover:bg-primary-4 hover:[&amp;&gt;svg]:opacity-60 focus:outline-primary-44 -ms-1 active:scale-95\" aria-label=\"下一条客户评价\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><use href=\"/icons/cms/27bb77900ed6df73/arrow-right-lg.svg#size-16\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class=\"border-primary-12 bg-secondary-100 dark:border-primary-4 dark:bg-tertiary-100 relative rounded-md border shadow-[0_18px_60px_rgb(0_0_0/0.08)] px-6 py-8\"><div data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-scroll-region\" class=\"no-scrollbar relative scroll-smooth snap-x snap-mandatory overflow-x-auto overflow-y-hidden overscroll-x-contain\"><div class=\"sticky inset-s-0 top-0 grid w-full\"><figure aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 grid gap-5 self-start transition-opacity duration-250 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)] opacity-100\"><div data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-card-header\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-5 mb-10\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"IMC\" class=\"ms-2 dark:brightness-0 dark:invert block h-8 w-32 max-w-full bg-contain bg-left bg-no-repeat md:w-48\" style=\"background-image:url(&quot;/__cdn_openai_com_____/mdx-assets/e193aefe-5e58-431c-8cd2-adadac0c1496/imc-quote-logo.749a3315.png&quot;)\"></span></div><blockquote class=\"relative ms-[0.5em] text-h5 font-medium tracking-tight text-pretty text-primary-100\"><span class=\"absolute inset-s-[-0.5em] top-0\">“</span><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\">我们评估了 GPT-6.2 Astra 将密集信息转化为易读简报和信息图的能力，受众同时涵盖技术与非技术人员。示例包括交易简报和智能体工作流示意图。</p><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0 inline\">GPT-6.2 Astra 生成的文档相比 GPT-6 Astra 有了显著提升。文字和图表让简报重点更易于把握，示意图则通过展示各部分如何协同工作，让复杂系统变得清晰易懂。</p>”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"ms-[0.5em] text-meta text-primary-60\">Marquis Wong，IMC 首席 AI 工程师</figcaption></figure><figure aria-hidden=\"true\" inert=\"\" class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 grid gap-5 self-start transition-opacity duration-250 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)] pointer-events-none invisible opacity-0\"><div data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-card-header\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-5 mb-10\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Legora\" class=\"ms-2 dark:brightness-0 dark:invert block h-8 w-32 max-w-full bg-contain bg-left bg-no-repeat md:w-48\" style=\"background-image:url(&quot;/__cdn_openai_com_____/mdx-assets/e193aefe-5e58-431c-8cd2-adadac0c1496/41104c38-087f-45d0-bbbb-d92a8a9a6435.86187730.png&quot;)\"></span></div><blockquote class=\"relative ms-[0.5em] text-h5 font-medium tracking-tight text-pretty text-primary-100\"><span class=\"absolute inset-s-[-0.5em] top-0\">“</span><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0 inline\">在我们的智能体评估中，GPT-6.2 Astra 处理复杂法律智能体任务时，Token 用量比 GPT-6.1 Sol 少 62%。Astra 在法律研究方面表现最强：我们测试的 10 项研究任务涵盖税务、并购和诉讼，其中 8 项的得分高于其他模型。</p>”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"ms-[0.5em] text-meta text-primary-60\">Jacob Lauritzen，Legora 首席技术官</figcaption></figure><figure aria-hidden=\"true\" inert=\"\" class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 grid gap-5 self-start transition-opacity duration-250 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)] pointer-events-none invisible opacity-0\"><div data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-card-header\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-5 mb-10\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Harvey\" class=\"ms-2 dark:brightness-0 dark:invert block h-8 w-32 max-w-full bg-contain bg-left bg-no-repeat md:w-48\" style=\"background-image:url(&quot;/__cdn_openai_com_____/mdx-assets/e193aefe-5e58-431c-8cd2-adadac0c1496/harvey-quote-logo.4f2d3730.png&quot;)\"></span></div><blockquote class=\"relative ms-[0.5em] text-h5 font-medium tracking-tight text-pretty text-primary-100\"><span class=\"absolute inset-s-[-0.5em] top-0\">“</span><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0 inline\">GPT-6.2 Astra 相比 GPT-6 Astra 有了显著进步：在我们的评估中，它完成的 Legal Agent Benchmark 任务数量超过后者的 3 倍，输出 Token 用量却减少了 34.5%。在内部备忘录起草任务中，GPT-6.2 Astra 发现了更多客户立场中的薄弱之处，起草的诉讼文书中也更少出现不必要的让步。</p>”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"ms-[0.5em] text-meta text-primary-60\">Niko Grupen，Harvey 应用研究负责人</figcaption></figure><figure aria-hidden=\"true\" inert=\"\" class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 grid gap-5 self-start transition-opacity duration-250 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)] pointer-events-none invisible opacity-0\"><div data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-card-header\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-5 mb-10\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"ClickUp\" class=\"ms-2 dark:brightness-0 dark:invert block h-8 w-32 max-w-full bg-contain bg-left bg-no-repeat md:w-48\" style=\"background-image:url(&quot;/__cdn_openai_com_____/mdx-assets/e193aefe-5e58-431c-8cd2-adadac0c1496/0041f84f-752c-4f8c-93bf-f0f4228e405e.46cfe310.png&quot;)\"></span></div><blockquote class=\"relative ms-[0.5em] text-h5 font-medium tracking-tight text-pretty text-primary-100\"><span class=\"absolute inset-s-[-0.5em] top-0\">“</span><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0 inline\">在 ClickUp Brain 于工作空间内构建的应用、仪表板和幻灯片上，GPT-6.2 Astra 在盲测中略胜我们的生产模型。更突出的是它实现这一结果的方式：Token 用量减少约 40%，审阅轮次减少 30%。</p>”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"ms-[0.5em] text-meta text-primary-60\">Jay Hack，ClickUp AI 负责人</figcaption></figure></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex h-0 w-full\"><div class=\"h-px w-full shrink-0 snap-center snap-always\"></div><div class=\"h-px w-full shrink-0 snap-center snap-always\"></div><div class=\"h-px w-full shrink-0 snap-center snap-always\"></div><div class=\"h-px w-full shrink-0 snap-center snap-always\"></div></div></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-tail\" class=\"border-primary-12 bg-secondary-100 dark:border-primary-4 dark:bg-tertiary-100 -translate-inline-1/2 pointer-events-none absolute bottom-[-0.4rem] z-1 hidden size-3 rotate-45 rounded-xs border-e border-b md:block\" style=\"inset-inline-start:12.5%\"></span></div><div class=\"relative mt-3 overflow-hidden\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-1 hidden md:block\"><ul class=\"flex\" style=\"width:100%;mask-image:linear-gradient(#000 0 0);mask-position:0% 0;mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-size:25% 100%;-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(#000 0 0);-webkit-mask-position:0% 0;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-size:25% 100%\"><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 25%\"><div class=\"flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full p-2 text-center text-caption text-balance text-primary-100\">IMC</div></li><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 25%\"><div class=\"flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full p-2 text-center text-caption text-balance text-primary-100\">Legora</div></li><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 25%\"><div class=\"flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full p-2 text-center text-caption text-balance text-primary-100\">Harvey</div></li><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 25%\"><div class=\"flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full p-2 text-center text-caption text-balance text-primary-100\">ClickUp</div></li></ul></div><ul class=\"relative flex\" style=\"width:100%\" aria-label=\"客户评价\"><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 25%\"><button type=\"button\" aria-current=\"true\" aria-label=\"显示来自 IMC 的推荐语\" class=\"relative flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center bg-transparent p-2 text-center text-caption text-primary-60 transition-[background-color,color,opacity,transform] duration-short ease-curve-a focus-visible:z-1 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-44 active:scale-98 w-full rounded-full hover:bg-primary-4 text-primary-100 md:text-primary-60\"><span class=\"text-balance\">IMC</span></button></li><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 25%\"><button type=\"button\" aria-current=\"false\" aria-label=\"显示来自 Legora 的推荐语\" class=\"relative flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center bg-transparent p-2 text-center text-caption text-primary-60 transition-[background-color,color,opacity,transform] duration-short ease-curve-a focus-visible:z-1 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-44 active:scale-98 w-full rounded-full hover:bg-primary-4\"><span class=\"text-balance\">Legora</span></button></li><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 25%\"><button type=\"button\" aria-current=\"false\" aria-label=\"显示来自 Harvey 的推荐语\" class=\"relative flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center bg-transparent p-2 text-center text-caption text-primary-60 transition-[background-color,color,opacity,transform] duration-short ease-curve-a focus-visible:z-1 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-44 active:scale-98 w-full rounded-full hover:bg-primary-4\"><span class=\"text-balance\">Harvey</span></button></li><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 25%\"><button type=\"button\" aria-current=\"false\" aria-label=\"显示来自 ClickUp 的推荐语\" class=\"relative flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center bg-transparent p-2 text-center text-caption text-primary-60 transition-[background-color,color,opacity,transform] duration-short ease-curve-a focus-visible:z-1 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-44 active:scale-98 w-full rounded-full hover:bg-primary-4\"><span class=\"text-balance\">ClickUp</span></button></li></ul></div></div></div></section></div>",
